WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:04.640
This video shows how a student views exam results on a phone.

00:00:06.324 --> 00:00:14.436
Tap the menu button and choose Results. Each published exam has a header with your total, percentage and grade.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:30.803
Under each exam, every subject has its marks, a percentage and a Pass or Fail badge.

00:00:38.603 --> 00:00:45.323
Tap an exam title to show only that exam. A paper you missed shows as Absent.

00:00:53.603 --> 00:00:57.467
New results appear here once the school publishes them.
